            <span id="algorithm2.6.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Phase 1: Boundary Lookup</span><span id="algorithm2.6.4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span>
</div>
