<div id="algorithm2.6.8" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.6.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">// </span><span id="algorithm2.6.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Slice fixed size <math id="algorithm2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{B}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" mathcolor="#808080">𝐁</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" mathcolor="#808080">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{B}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> regardless of actual child count </span>
</div>
